    "reviewTitle": "Love these shower steamers!",
    "reviewDescription": "I decided to give these steamers a try to make my showers feel a little more relaxing, and they did not disappoint. The eucalyptus and menthol scent is fresh and noticeable without being overpowering. I used one when I was feeling stuffy, and the steam combined with the scent made for a really refreshing shower and helped me breathe easier. I also like that each steamer lasts most of my shower instead of dissolving right away. The bag is resealable, which helps keep the rest fresh, and 15 steamers is a great value. If you’re looking for an easy way to make your shower feel more like a spa or want a little extra comfort during cold season, I’d definitely recommend giving these a try. They don’t disappoint!",
